    "description": "**Essential** — Baseline hygiene for Lab Services: the non-negotiable controls every deployment should enforce from day one. This tier delivers tagging, SKU, and naming controls for cost and ownership accountability. Together these policies protect against credential theft, unencrypted data exposure, and accidental data loss. Maps to CIS Benchmarks, ISO 27001 Annex A.10 (cryptography) and A.12 (operations).",
